 <p id="source-afh"><strong>[2] Federal Aviation Administration, FAA-H-8083-3C, Airplane Flying Handbook (2021).</strong> Read the same way: <a href="https://www.faa.gov/sites/faa.gov/files/regulations_policies/handbooks_manuals/aviation/airplane_handbook/05_afh_ch4.pdf">Chapter 4, Energy Management</a> and <a href="https://www.faa.gov/sites/faa.gov/files/regulations_policies/handbooks_manuals/aviation/airplane_handbook/06_afh_ch5.pdf">chapter 5, Maintaining Aircraft Control: Upset Prevention and Recovery Training</a>. Inspected 25 October 2026: pp. 4-1–4-8, 4-18, 5-1–5-24. A US Government work, public domain.</p>
